00:04:42,000 --> 00:04:48,000
Every war has its casualties.

2
00:09:24,000 --> 00:09:30,000
Hostile Territory is a western, action, drama film directed by Brian Presley.

3
00:14:06,000 --> 00:14:12,000
Former P.O.W.

4
00:18:48,000 --> 00:18:54,000
Jack Calgrove moves Heaven and Earth to be reunited with
his children following the Civil War.

5
00:23:30,000 --> 00:23:36,000
After returning home, Jack discovers that his wife has tragically died and his children, presumed to be orphans, are
heading deep into the West on a train crossing enemy lines, with the intent of being placed into new homes.

6
00:28:12,000 --> 00:28:18,000
Calgrove and another soldier team up with a troop of Native American
sharpshooters and a freed slave as they try to stop the train.

7
00:32:54,000 --> 00:33:00,000
Jack Calgrove, played by Brian Presley.

8
00:37:36,000 --> 00:37:42,000
Andrew Lee, played by Matt McCoy.

9
00:42:18,000 --> 00:42:24,000
Frank Smith, played by Brad Leland.

10
00:47:00,000 --> 00:47:06,000
Sarah, played by Brea Bee.

11
00:51:42,000 --> 00:51:48,000
Daniel Glenn, played by Lew Temple.

12
00:56:24,000 --> 00:56:30,000
