13
01:01:06,000 --> 01:01:12,000
Interceptor is a 2022 action thriller film directed by Matthew Reilly in his directorial
debut, from a screenplay by Reilly and Stuart Beattie and a story by Reilly.

14
01:05:48,000 --> 01:05:54,000
An international co-production between Australia and the United
States, the film stars Elsa Pataky and Luke Bracey.

15
01:10:30,000 --> 01:10:36,000
It follows a tough and reality-bruised army officer who finds herself in charge of a lone nuclear missile interceptor base
in the middle of the Pacific Ocean after she is wrongfully drummed out of her dream job at the Pentagon.

16
01:15:12,000 --> 01:15:18,000
The film began streaming on Netflix on June 3, 2022, and climbed to number one on
the streamer's top 10 list with about 50 million hours viewed.

17
01:19:54,000 --> 01:20:00,000
It received mixed reviews from critics, and was nominated for
Best Production Design at the 12th AACTA Awards.

18
01:24:36,000 --> 01:24:42,000
The film explores themes of civil war, orphanage, train, orphan, post war.

19
01:29:18,000 --> 01:29:24,000
The tone is emotional and thought_provoking.
